      "content": "idk if people even care. they just want the old version of me back. but that person doesn't exist anymore. i feel like i'm just taking up space, like a ghost that hasn't realized it's dead yet. it's just so exhausting to keep pretending like there's a reason to keep going when everything that made me me is gone.",
